WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:08.691
In this video, you will add a local business as a sponsor of your contest, with its logo and website, so it gets thanked on your contest page.

00:00:08.691 --> 00:00:09.851
We start on the map.

00:00:10.752 --> 00:00:12.501
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:14.095 --> 00:00:16.612
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:18.358 --> 00:00:19.339
Then tap Allow.

00:00:23.034 --> 00:00:25.723
Now look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:25.723 --> 00:00:26.919
See the three dots?

00:00:26.919 --> 00:00:31.221
That is the menu, and it is the doorway to everything else on the site.

00:00:31.221 --> 00:00:31.759
Tap them.

00:00:33.362 --> 00:00:35.176
In the menu, tap Contests.

00:00:36.837 --> 00:00:41.935
That is where every neighborhood contest lives: the ones you can vote in, enter, or run.

00:00:42.636 --> 00:00:43.553
Tap Mine.

00:00:45.408 --> 00:00:46.986
This is your personal page.

00:00:46.986 --> 00:00:52.171
It lists the contests you run, if you run any, and the homes you entered, with their status.

00:00:52.878 --> 00:00:54.948
Tap Manage, next to your contest.

00:00:56.754 --> 00:01:00.167
This opens your dashboard, the control room for your contest.

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.414
A sponsor is a local business that supports your contest.

00:01:04.414 --> 00:01:07.286
Their name and logo show on your contest page.

00:01:07.286 --> 00:01:08.080
Tap Sponsors.

00:01:09.905 --> 00:01:12.544
Type the sponsor's name, and choose a tier.

00:01:12.544 --> 00:01:15.963
Sponsors are listed by tier, so the top tier shows first.

00:01:17.578 --> 00:01:19.989
Add their website, so people can click through.

00:01:23.563 --> 00:01:25.360
Then choose their logo.

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:31.200
Use a clear picture, a J P G, P N G, or WebP file under six hundred kilobytes.

00:01:32.105 --> 00:01:33.342
Tap Add sponsor.

00:01:35.324 --> 00:01:39.886
Sponsors can support your contest directly, and any payment goes to you.

00:01:39.886 --> 00:01:43.260
One rule is important: payment never affects who wins.

00:01:44.164 --> 00:01:51.204
To check how it looks, tap See it as voters do, and you will see the sponsors on the contest page, just as your neighbors do.

00:01:53.185 --> 00:01:56.086
Next up: Presenting installer and quote requests.
